[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Godot 4.5.1 stable (.NET / C#)\n- Godot 4.5.1 stable (GDScript)\n\n### System information\n\nDeveloping on Windows 11 to physical device on android 14 (emulator also breaks)\n\n### Issue description\n\nAndroid exports fail at runtime with the error:\n\n```\nERROR: Can't open pack-referenced file 'res://assets.sparsepck'.\n```\n\nLogCat:\n\n```\nERROR: Can't open pack-referenced file 'res://assets.sparsepck'.\n   at: open (core/io/file_access_pack.cpp)\nERROR: File must be opened before use.\n   at: get_64 (core/io/file_access.cpp)\nERROR: Condition \"num_read == (18446744073709551615UL)\" is true. Returning: 0\n   at: _get_buffer (core/io/file_access.cpp)\nERROR: No loader found for resource:  (expected type: unknown)\n   at: _load (core/io/resource_loader.cpp)\nERROR: Failed loading resource: res://path/to/texture.png.\n```\n\n\nThis prevents any resources (textures, scenes, etc.) from loading. The game launches but immediately fails to load any assets and logs a lot of errors about being unable to load textures.\n\n\n- Tested on both C# (.NET) and GDScript versions of Godot 4.5.1 - same issue on both\n- The same scene setup as the min repro with just the camera 2D (not references to the images) works fine to export\n- Both APK (export_format=0) and AAB (export_format=1) formats fail\n- Clean rebuilds (deleting `.godot/`, `android/` folder, reinstalling Android build template) do not fix the issue\n- If you remove all references to the pngs in the MainMenu.tscn scene tree then the export works no problem but lacks any of my assets \n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Open the attached minimal reproduction project in Godot 4.5.1\n2. Export to Android with Gradle build enabled\n3. Install and run on device\n4. App fails to load any resources\n\nI've tried side loading the APK as well as remote debugging. Both result in the same issue\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[SparsePckErr.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/24410292/SparsePckErr.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114528/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114528/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}